आज आज, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. 1. अज), coming
from goats, belonging to goats, produced by goats;
(अस्), m. a vulture; (अम्), n. boiled or clarified butter;
ghee.

अजानेय अजानेय, better आजानेय, अस्, आ, अम्
(from आजान, आजानि, birth, descent), of high breed;
undaunted, fearless; (अस्), m. a horse of high breed.
